---
import HubFooter from "../../../components/aopa/HubFooter.astro";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8" />
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
	<title>General Aviation Safety Resources | AOPA</title>
	<meta
		name="description"
		content="Free AOPA safety courses, accident lessons and analysis; weather, flight operations, human factors, and general aviation safety tips and videos."
	/>
</head>
<body>

<div class="home">
	<header class="home__header" id="home-header">
		<img class="home__chrome" src="/images/aopa/home/1/chrome-100.jpg" alt="" />
		<img class="home__mini-nav" src="/images/aopa/home/1/mini-nav-100.jpg" alt="" />
	</header>

	<section class="js-hub-hero hub-hero relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0d1b2a]">
		<img
			class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-cover"
			src="/images/aopa/hub/safety/23_eFIRC3079-cropped.jpg"
			alt=""
		/>
		<div
			class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(13,27,42,0.15)_0%,rgba(13,27,42,0.75)_78%,rgba(13,27,42,0.95)_100%)]"
		></div>

		<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-end justify-end overflow-hidden">
			<div class="grid">
				<span class="js-hub-hero-watermark-overlay [grid-area:1/1] translate-y-[0.2em] mix-blend-overlay font-national text-[10rem] font-bold uppercase leading-none text-white sm:text-[14rem] lg:text-[14rem]">
					Safety
				</span>
				<span class="js-hub-hero-watermark-solid [grid-area:1/1] translate-y-[0.2em] mix-blend-normal font-national text-[10rem] font-bold uppercase leading-none text-white opacity-0 sm:text-[14rem] lg:text-[14rem]">
					Safety
				</span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative z-[1] mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(85vh-var(--chrome-h))] w-full max-w-8xl flex-col justify-end px-8 pb-20 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
			<h1 class="mt-3 max-w-[15ch] font-national text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl lg:text-6xl">
				Knowledge that flies with you
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 max-w-[46ch] font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-white/80 sm:text-2xl">
				Free aviation safety resources to keep your flying skills sharp.
			</p>
		</div>


	</section>

	<!-- ===== INTRO ===== -->
	<section class="relative flex min-h-[36vh] items-center overflow-hidden bg-white px-8 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl py-24">
			<h2 class="mb-4 font-national text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#182f56] sm:text-4xl">
				Free aviation safety resources to keep your flying skills sharp
			</h2>
			<p class="font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-600 sm:text-2xl">
				At AOPA, we’re dedicated to improving general aviation safety. The AOPA Air Safety Institute (ASI)
				offers pilots free aviation safety courses, accident reports, videos, and quizzes, all funded by
				AOPA Foundation donors. You can earn FAA Wings credit and Accident Forgiveness from participating
				insurance carriers. The free ASI transcript tracks your progress. Choose a topic below to fight
				complacency and sharpen the skills that bring you home.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>



	<!-- ===== FEATURED TOOL MODULE ===== -->
	<section class="js-tool-module relative overflow-hidden bg-white px-8 pb-36 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">
			<div class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-8">
				<h2 class="max-w-[20ch] font-national text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#182f56] sm:text-4xl">
					Choose a safety topic
				</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate col-span-full flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-gray-100 no-underline sm:flex-row sm:h-[22rem]">
					<div class="relative h-48 w-full shrink-0 overflow-hidden sm:h-full sm:w-2/5">
						<img
							src="/images/aopa/hub/safety/mechanic-compressed.jpg"
							alt=""
							class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-cover"
						/>
					</div>
					<div class="relative flex flex-1 flex-col justify-center max-w-[40rem] gap-3 p-7">
						<div>
							<span class="font-national text-2xl font-medium text-gray-800">AOPA Air Safety Institute</span>
							<p class="mt-2 font-national text-xl font-light text-gray-600">
								The world's largest provider of free general aviation safety content, the AOPA Air Safety
								Institute puts decades of accident analysis, free courses, real-world scenarios, and
								training resources in your hands, so the right instinct is there when you need it.
							</p>
						</div>
						<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Air Safety Institute →</span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-gray-100 p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-gray-800">Accident Analysis</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-gray-600">
							Night accidents account for 7 percent of all general aviation accidents, but fatal night
							accidents account for 16 percent of fatal GA accidents. The Richard G. McSpadden Report and
							others uncover the reasons behind accident statistics, so pilots can fly ready.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Accident Analysis →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-gray-100 p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-gray-800">Flight Operations</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-gray-600">
							Runway safety, collision avoidance, mountain flying, backcountry, instrument flight rules,
							and the safety procedures that keep each phase of a flight on plan, from taxi to takeoff to
							touchdown.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Flight Operations →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-gray-100 p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-gray-800">Weather</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-gray-600">
							Forecasts are educated guesses, not guarantees. Get preflight and en route weather guidance
							and decision making for the calls that matter most, from icing to visual flight rules into
							instrument meteorological conditions to turbulence and low visibility.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Weather →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-gray-100 p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-gray-800">Human Factors</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-gray-600">
							Pilot-related causes account for about 70 percent of noncommercial, fixed-wing GA
							accidents, per the McSpadden Report. We cover the judgments behind accidents: personal
							minimums, fitness to fly, and fatigue, the calls you make on the ground and in the air.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Human Factors →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-gray-100 p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="font-national text-xl font-medium text-gray-800">Aircraft Systems and Avionics</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-gray-600">
							Know your equipment. Engines, propellers, electrical, and vacuum: how each works, the
							warning signs before it quits, and what changes when you move to a different aircraft. Get
							safety quizzes and tips, videos, and a credit-earning course.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Aircraft Systems and Avionics →</span>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="relative isolate flex min-h-[200px] flex-col justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-black/5 bg-gray-100 p-7 no-underline">
					<div class="relative">
						<span class="block font-national text-xl font-medium text-gray-800">Resources for Flight Schools</span>
						<p class="mt-2 font-national text-lg font-light text-gray-600">
							For the people teaching the next generation to fly: FAA and Transportation Security
							Administration guidance for flight schools, business planning and operations, training
							field guides, instructor awards, and the Flight School Business News and Network.
						</p>
						<span class="mt-3 inline-block font-national text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#01a2e0]">Flight School Resources →</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>


	<!-- ===== PROOF (STATS) + AOPA IN ACTION ===== -->
	<section class="js-hub-advocacy relative overflow-hidden bg-[#1d3f6d] px-8 py-36 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<img
			class="js-hub-advocacy-bg pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 -top-[100%] h-[300%] w-full select-none object-cover will-change-transform"
			src="/images/aopa/home/4/sky-portrait.jpg"
			alt=""
		/>
		<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[#1d3f6d]/55"></div>

		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">
			<div class="js-reveal mb-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
				<div class="mr-12">
					<h2 class="max-w-[32ch] font-national text-3xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-4xl">
						The fatal accident rate is down 60 percent; we work to keep it falling
					</h2>
					<p class="mt-6 max-w-[60ch] font-national text-lg font-light leading-relaxed text-white/90">
						Since 1950, the AOPA Air Safety Institute has worked to build a safer culture in general
						aviation. Our courses, spotlights, and videos are built on lived experience: pilots telling
						you what went wrong and what they learned. The GA fatal accident rate has fallen 60 percent
						since 1994. Safe pilots, safe skies.
					</p>
				</div>
				<blockquote class="max-w-[42ch] font-national text-2xl font-light italic leading-snug text-white">
					“We’ve made tremendous progress in GA safety, but our work isn’t done. Every pilot we reach is
					another opportunity to make flying safer.”
					<footer class="mt-2 font-national text-sm not-italic font-light text-white/60">
						Paul Deres, VP of Operations, AOPA Air Safety Institute
					</footer>
				</blockquote>
			</div>

			<div class="js-reveal mb-20 grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3">
				<a href="#" class="no-underline">
					<div class="font-national text-5xl font-bold text-[#7ce0ff]">1950</div>
					<p class="mt-3 font-national text-xl font-medium text-white">
						the year ASI began building a safer culture for general aviation
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 font-national text-xl font-light text-white/80">
						Funded by donations to the AOPA Foundation; its education is free to every pilot.
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="no-underline">
					<div class="font-national text-5xl font-bold text-[#7ce0ff]">~50%</div>
					<p class="mt-3 font-national text-xl font-medium text-white">
						reduction in the fatal flight training accident rate over 20 years
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 font-national text-xl font-light text-white/80">
						ASI Fatal Flight Training Accident Report, executive summary.
					</p>
				</a>
				<a href="#" class="no-underline">
					<div class="font-national text-5xl font-bold text-[#7ce0ff]">Six carriers</div>
					<p class="mt-3 font-national text-xl font-medium text-white">
						waive part or all of a deductible for qualifying ASI education
					</p>
					<p class="mt-2 font-national text-xl font-light text-white/80">
						Completed within six months before an accident; terms live on the ASI page, not here.
					</p>
				</a>
			</div>

			<div class="js-reveal grid gap-10 rounded-lg bg-[#0d1b2a]/50 p-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
				<div>
					<div class="mb-3 font-national font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7ce0ff]">
						AOPA in Action
					</div>
					<h3 class="max-w-[26ch] font-national text-2xl font-extrabold text-white">
						Improving safety at more than 90 towers
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] font-national font-light leading-relaxed text-white/90 text-xl">
						More than 90 federal contract towers still work without radar, a gap in air traffic
						safety. AOPA backs the Air Traffic Situational Awareness Enhancement Act (S.3929), which
						would put ADS-B position tools in those towers so controllers can see the traffic they
						are talking to. The Senate Commerce Committee advanced it the Fall offin 2026.
					</p>
					<a
						href="#"
						class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-national text-lg font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7ce0ff] no-underline"
					>
						See what else we’re fighting for →
					</a>
					<p class="mt-4 font-national text-sm font-light text-white/50">
						Source: AOPA Government Affairs, September 2026
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="js-hub-advocacy-photo relative min-h-[280px] overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
					<img
						src="/images/aopa/hub/safety/tower.jpg"
						alt=""
						class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-cover"
					/>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ===== MEMBER BENEFIT ===== -->
	<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-white">
		<div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-6 px-8 py-16 sm:px-12 lg:px-16 xl:pl-24">
				<div class="mx-auto w-fit">
					<h3 class="max-w-[26ch] font-national text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#182f56]">
						Every pilot flies safer; members fly with more
					</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 max-w-[44ch] font-national text-2xl font-light text-gray-500 mb-8">
						ASI courses, case studies, and quizzes are free to every pilot. Members also get the
						pilot helpline, award-winning publications, and exclusive flight planning and ownership
						tools.
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
						<a
							href="#"
							class="js-learn-more-4 js-plane-runway-btn relative mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-7 rounded-full bg-[#182f56] py-2 pl-10 pr-2 no-underline"
						>
							<span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full" aria-hidden="true">
								<span
									class="js-learn-more-4-flair pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 origin-top-left scale-0 will-change-transform"
									aria-hidden="true"
								>
									<span class="absolute left-0 top-0 aspect-square w-[260%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-[#5b9bd5] opacity-40"></span>
								</span>
							</span>
							<span class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
								<span class="js-plane-runway-icon absolute left-6 top-[-4px] grid h-6 w-6 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center text-[#5b9bd5] opacity-0">
									<svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="currentColor" class="h-full w-full">
										<path d="M30.79,10.85l-2.33-2.99v-.02c-1.57-1.92-4.3-2.4-6.42-1.14l-6.45,3.85-6.74-2.48c-.23-.08-.47-.08-.7,0l-.9.34-.04.02c-1.02.44-1.48,1.61-1.05,2.63.11.26.28.49.48.68l2.73,2.65-2.52,1.52-3.53-1.19c-.25-.08-.52-.07-.76.05l-.38.18c-1.01.45-1.46,1.63-1.01,2.64.11.24.26.45.45.63l4.5,4.41h.01c.92.89,2.14,1.37,3.41,1.37.89,0,1.76-.24,2.53-.69l18.43-11c.47-.28.63-.9.35-1.37-.02-.04-.04-.07-.07-.1h0Z" />
									</svg>
								</span>
							</span>
							<span class="js-learn-more-4-label relative font-national font-medium  uppercase tracking-widest text-white">
								Join AOPA
							</span>
							<span
								class="js-learn-more-4-icon relative grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-white text-[#182f56]"
								aria-hidden="true"
							>
								<svg class="js-learn-more-4-arrow h-8 w-8 rotate-45" viewBox="0 0 41.69 43.1" fill="none">
									<polygon
										fill="currentColor"
										points="30.75 21.39 27.61 18.25 24.66 15.09 24.85 17.26 24.83 43.05 16.76 43.1 16.77 17.45 16.82 15.38 12.56 19.77 0 32.33 0 20.83 5.47 15.32 8.82 12 12.8 7.99 20.87 0 41.68 20.8 41.69 32.33 38.04 28.68 30.75 21.39"
									/>
								</svg>
							</span>
						</a>
						<a
							href="#"
							class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#182f56]/20 px-7 py-3.5 font-national text-[0.95rem] font-bold text-[#182f56] no-underline"
						>
							Find a Free ASI Course
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="relative min-h-[70vh] overflow-hidden">
				<img
					src="/images/aopa/hub/template/two-pilots.jpg"
					alt=""
					class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-cover"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ===== FAQ + ELSEWHERE + PROVENANCE ===== -->
	<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#f2f2f2] px-8 py-24 sm:px-12 lg:px-24">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-24 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr] lg:gap-x-64">
			<div>
				<h2 class="mb-8 font-national text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#182f56]">
					Questions Pilots Ask
				</h2>

				<div class="js-faq border-t border-[#182f56]/10">
				<div class="js-faq-item is-open border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-xl font-national text-base font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						What is the AOPA Air Safety Institute, and is its content free to use?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							The AOPA Air Safety Institute (ASI) is AOPA's safety education program, and its
							safety courses, videos, and quizzes are free to every pilot. ASI has worked to
							improve general aviation safety since 1950, and donations to the AOPA Foundation
							fund its programs. Find pilot safety resources at
							<a href="#" class="text-[#01a2e0] no-underline hover:underline">ASI</a>.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national text-base font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						Which AOPA safety courses earn FAA Wings credit?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							AOPA Air Safety Institute (ASI) online courses that earn FAA Wings credit are
							clearly labeled on their ASI course page. Credit reaches your FAA Wings record
							automatically when the course is completed and reflected on your ASI transcript.
							Note: your AOPA account email needs to match your FAASafety.gov email. See which
							courses qualify at the
							<a href="#" class="text-[#01a2e0] no-underline hover:underline">AOPA Air Safety Institute</a>.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national  font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						Which ASI courses count toward AOPA Accident Forgiveness?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							One qualifying AOPA Air Safety Institute (ASI) activity, such as one interactive
							online course, one live safety webinar, two Accident Case Study videos, or three
							safety quizzes, completed within six months before an accident counts toward AOPA
							Accident Forgiveness. Benefits vary by insurance carrier. See how the program works
							on the
							<a href="#" class="text-[#01a2e0] no-underline hover:underline">Accident Forgiveness</a> page.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national  font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						Where do I find my ASI transcript?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
						<p class="mb-5 font-national text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-500">
							Your AOPA Air Safety Institute (ASI) transcript lives in your eLearning Profile.
							Sign in with your AOPA account and open My Transcript from the AOPA Air Safety
							Institute. Older completions move over with the Load My Previous Transcript
							button, and past certificates download from the same page. Select
							<a href="#" class="text-[#01a2e0] no-underline hover:underline">My Transcript at the AOPA Air Safety Institute</a>.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="js-faq-item border-b border-[#182f56]/10">
					<button type="button" class="js-faq-q flex w-full items text-xl items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left font-national  font-bold text-[#182f56]">
						What is the leading cause of general aviation accidents?
						<span class="js-faq-plus font-national text-xl font-light text-[#01a2e0]">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="js-faq-a overflow-hidden">
